mprovements within the first 90 days.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details class="faq-item">\n        <summary class="faq-item__question">What kind of support do you provide after implementation?</summary>\n        <p class="faq-item__answer">We're committed to your long-term success. Our support includes ongoing monitoring, optimization, and strategic guidance to ensure your AI solutions continue delivering value. You can reach us at leopardess.consulting@contactforsales.com or call +44 (0) 7934 524 911. We work closely with your team to adapt solutions as your business evolves.</p>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>	\N	\N	\N	412ed8d6-8a64-414b-944d-645a28227839	2026-02-17 17:52:49.885616+00	2026-02-17 17:52:49.885616+00	deployed	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
