b512c491-292f-41bf-b010-125449d79c9a	ebc2c413-61e2-465e-b22b-9aab0167abc9	\N	2	services-grid	\N	<section class="services-section" data-component="services-grid">\n    <div class="services-container">\n        <h2>What We Build</h2>\n        \n        <div class="services-grid">\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Hierarchical Multi-Agent Orchestration</h3>\n                <p>We design and deploy multi-agent AI systems where specialised agents work under coordinating supervisors — breaking complex tasks into parallel workstreams, handling failures gracefully, and delivering results at scale. Built on Kubernetes for resilience, Kafka for event-driven messaging, and Postgres for reliable state management.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Web Automation Agents</h3>\n                <p>Agents that navigate, extract, interact with, and act on the web — autonomously. Whether you need competitive intelligence, form processing, data pipelines from live sources, or workflow automation across web-based tools, we build agents that do the work without human babysitting.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>AI Agent Deployment & Infrastructure</h3>\n                <p>From a standing start to a running system in minutes, not weeks. We provision, configure, and harden the infrastructure your agents live on — Kubernetes clusters, Kafka topics, Postgres schemas, secrets management, and monitoring — so your team inherits something solid, not something fragile.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Enterprise-Grade Security & Reliability</h3>\n                <p>Production systems carry production responsibilities. We build with security-first principles: network policies, role-based access, encrypted data at rest and in transit, and audit trails baked in from day one. Your agents operate with the reliability your business depends on.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Rapid Prototyping to Production</h3>\n                <p>We compress the journey from idea to deployed system. Our agile approach means early iterations are functional, feedback loops are short, and the path to production is measured in days. No lengthy discovery phases. No committee-approved roadmaps before a single line runs.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Custom AI Integration</h3>\n                <p>Existing platforms, internal tools, third-party APIs — we wire AI agents into the systems you already operate. Whether that means connecting to your CRM, your data warehouse, or your proprietary APIs, we build the integration layer that makes your agents useful inside your actual business context.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n/* Layout only - colors inherited from global CSS */\n.services-section {\n    padding: var(--spacing-section, 5rem 2rem);\n}\n.services-container {\n    max-width: var(--container-max-width, 1200px);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.services-section h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n.services-subtitle {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 0 auto 3rem;\n}\n.services-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n}\n.service-item {\n    padding: 2rem;\n    background: var(--color-surface, #f8f9fa);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;\n}\n.service-item:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-4px);\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n}\n.service-item h3 {\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n.service-item p {\n    margin: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .services-section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }\n  