4b58071a-8e89-45b7-bb10-c535092be30f	ebc2c413-61e2-465e-b22b-9aab0167abc9	\N	3	differentiators-section	\N	<section class="differentiators-section" data-component="differentiators">\n        <div class="differentiators-container">\n            <h2>Why Leopardess Consulting</h2>\n            <div class="differentiators-grid">\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>We Build, We Don't Just Advise</h3>\n                    <p>We write the code, configure the infrastructure, and ship working systems. When you engage us, you get engineers who have deployed AI agents into production environments — not slide decks about what could be possible.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Agile AI Orchestration at Speed</h3>\n                    <p>Our approach to multi-agent orchestration is built for pace. Hierarchical agent systems that would typically take weeks to prototype can be running in your environment in a fraction of the time — without cutting corners on reliability.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>A Stack Built for the Real World</h3>\n                    <p>We work with Kubernetes, Kafka, and Postgres because they are proven at scale. Your deployments inherit enterprise-grade reliability, fault tolerance, and the kind of observability that lets you sleep at night.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Hierarchical Multi-Agent Expertise</h3>\n                    <p>Orchestrating a single AI agent is straightforward. Orchestrating systems where agents delegate, collaborate, and self-correct is a different discipline entirely. It is where we specialise, and where we deliver the most value.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Security and Reliability by Design</h3>\n                    <p>Automation that cannot be trusted is not automation — it is a liability. Every system we build is designed with access controls, audit trails, and resilience patterns from the ground up, not bolted on afterwards.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Web Automation as a Core Strength</h3>\n                    <p>Our sharpest focus is on intelligent web automation: agents that navigate, extract, act, and report across the web at scale. This is a deep specialism with room to grow, and the foundation for broader AI-driven workflows as your needs evolve.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n<style>\n.differentiators-section {\n    padding: var(--spacing-section, 5rem 2rem);\n    background: var(--color-background, #fff);\n}\n.differentiators-container {\n    max-width: var(--container-max-width, 1200px);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.differentiators-section h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);\n    margin-bottom: 3rem;\n    color: var(--color-primary, #1a1a2e);\n}\n.differentiators-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n}\n.differentiator-item {\n    padding: 2rem;\n    background: var(--color-surface, #f8f9fa);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent, #0f3460);\n}\n.differentiator-item h3 {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n    color: var(--color-primary, #1a1a2e);\n}\n.differentiator-item p {\n    color: var(--color-text-muted, #555);\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    margin: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .differentiators-section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }\n    .differentiators-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n</style>	\N	\N	\N	5d9067ea-1f18-4acf-837