4d799a43-ec32-4429-af6a-ccf36773a3f5	da53b6bc-0c4d-4744-947b-1b53cbce2839	96ceb704-57b9-4d27-b90a-1bfcf207b929	2	about-content	\N	<section class="about-content-section" data-component="about-content">\n    <div class="about-container">\n        <h2>About FineTuning</h2>\n        <div class="about-text">\n            <p>We're a London-based AI consultancy that helps UK businesses actually use artificial intelligence — not just talk about it.</p><p>Most companies don't need another presentation about AI's potential. They need someone who can look at their specific operations, identify where AI will genuinely save time and money, and then build solutions that work reliably from day one.</p><p>That's what we do. We take the latest AI models and make them yours — fine-tuned on your data, trained in your terminology, deployed to solve your particular problems. Whether it's a custom model that understands your industry's jargon, an intelligent agent system that handles complex workflows, or automated tools that your team can start using immediately, we build practical solutions that perform.</p><p>We work primarily with SMEs, managing directors, operations managers, and technical founders who are rightly sceptical of AI hype but curious about the genuine opportunities. Our approach is straightforward: understand your business, identify the tasks where AI will make a real difference right now, build it properly, and make sure it actually works.</p><p>No buzzword bingo. No five-year roadmaps that gather dust. Just honest advice about what's worth building and the technical expertise to deliver it.</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class="about-highlights">\n            \n            <div class="highlight-item">\n                <h3>Practical Focus</h3>\n                <p>We prioritise solutions that deliver measurable value quickly. If something won't save you time or money in the near term, we'll tell you.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="highlight-item">\n                <h3>Technical Depth</h3>\n                <p>From fine-tuning foundation models to building multi-agent systems, we handle the complex technical work so you don't have to.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="highlight-item">\n                <h3>Honest Guidance</h3>\n                <p>We're here to help you make good decisions about AI, even if that means advising against projects that aren't right for your business yet.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="highlight-item">\n                <h3>UK-Based Expertise</h3>\n                <p>Based in London, we understand the practical realities of running and growing a British business.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n.about-content-section {\n    padding: 5rem 2rem;\n    background: #fff;\n}\n.about-container {\n    max-width: 1000px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.about-content-section h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);\n    margin-bottom: 2rem;\n    color: #1a1a2e;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n.about-text {\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    color: #333;\n    margin-bottom: 3rem;\n}\n.about-text p {\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n}\n.about-highlights {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n    margin-top: 3rem;\n}\n.highlight-item {\n    padding: 1.5rem;\n    background: #f8f9fa;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border-left: 4px solid #0f3460;\n}\n.highlight-item h3 {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n    color: #1a1a2e;\n}\n.highlight-item p {\n    color: #555;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .about-content-section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }\n    .about-highlights { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n</style>	\N	\N	\N	0ce0672d-5b10-405b-b494-e0774d483005	2026-02-22 16:35:27.211685+00	2026-02-22 16:35:27.211685+