arent;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n.hero .btn-secondary {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: #fff;\n    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\n}\n.hero .btn-secondary:hover {\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .hero {\n        min-height: 60vh;\n        padding: 3rem 1.5rem;\n    }\n    .hero .btn {\n        display: block;\n        width: 100%;\n        max-width: 280px;\n        margin: 0.5rem auto;\n    }\n}\n</style>	\N	\N	\N	b79fcb4f-59f1-4c74-a8c0-f1a252f92645	2026-02-22 16:35:27.205987+00	2026-03-05 20:35:32.465944+00	deployed	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
00f7c458-b411-4ec2-91c8-2bb630b09638	06f7b3bc-1269-4cf9-aef1-3481b855aeee	\N	2	about-content	\N	<section class="about-content-section" data-component="about-content">\n    <div class="about-container">\n        <h2>About Leopardess Consulting</h2>\n        <div class="about-text">\n            <p>Leopardess Consulting builds AI agent systems that do real work. We are not a strategy-only consultancy that hands you a roadmap and steps away — we design, deploy, and run production-grade multi-agent architectures that automate meaningful parts of your business from day one.</p><p>Our focus is on orchestration: coordinating hierarchical networks of AI agents that delegate tasks intelligently, communicate in real time, and scale without friction. Built on a proven stack of Kubernetes, Kafka, and Postgres, our systems are engineered for the reliability and security that technology leaders actually need — not proof-of-concept demos, but production deployments that hold up under pressure.</p><p>Web automation is where we have sharpened our expertise most deeply. We can take a website from zero to a fully hosted, tested, and live deployment in minutes using our AI-powered multi-agent pipelines on Cloudflare — eliminating the slow, manual processes that typically consume weeks of engineering time. That same agile approach carries across everything we do: from designing custom agent systems tailored to your specific business challenges, to guiding your organisation through a practical, grounded digital transformation.</p><p>We work with technology leaders, CTOs, and forward-thinking businesses who want AI to actually function inside their operations — not sit as a line item in a strategy document. If you are ready to move with grace and precision into the next stage of automation, we are ready to build it with you.</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class="about-highlights">\n            \n            <div class="highlight-item">\n                <h3>Production-First Mindset</h3>\n                <p>Every system we build is designed to run in production from the start — built on Kubernetes, Kafka, and Postgres for enterprise-grade reliability and security.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="highlight-item">\n                <h3>Hierarchical Agent Orchestration</h3>\n                <p>We specialise in multi-agent architectures where tasks are delegated intelligently across coordinated agent networks, supporting a wide range of LLMs and models.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="highlight-item">\n                <h3>Fast, Automated Deployments</h3>\n                <p>Our AI-powered pipelines compress deployment timelines dramatically — getting production-ready websites and systems live in minutes rather than weeks.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="highlight-item">\n                <h3>Practical Digital Transformation</h3>\n                <p>We help organisations build clear, actionable roadmaps for AI adoption that fit how their teams actually work — no unnecessary complexity, no vague frameworks.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n.about-content-section {\n    padding: 5rem 2rem;\n    background: #fff;\n}\n.about-container {\n    max-width: 1000px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.about-content-section h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);\n    margin-bottom: 2rem;\n    color: #1a1a2e;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n.about-text {\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    color: #333;\n    margin-bottom: 3rem;\n}\n.about-text p {\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n}\n.about-highlights {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n    margin-top: 3rem;\n}\n.highlight-item {\n    padding: 1.5rem;\n    background: #f8f9fa;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border-left: 4px solid #0f3460;\n}\n.highlight-item h3 {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n    color: #1a1a2e;\n}\n.highlight-item p {\n    color: #555;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .about-content-section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }\n    .about-highlights { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n</style>	\N	\N	\N	e991a2f5-f562-4fab-b717-9112a7c1b3de	2026-03-09 18:18:38.507226+00	2026-03-09 18:18:38.507226+00	deployed	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
641f792e-2710-474b-a0f7-15deea02599c	06f7b3bc-1269-4cf9-aef1-3481b855aeee	\N	3	differentiators-section	\N	<section class="differentiators-section" data-component="differentiators">\n        <div class="differentiators-container">\n            <h2>What Sets Us Apart</h2>\n            <div class="differentiators-grid">\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>We Build, We Don't Just Advise</h3>\n                    <p>We are practitioners first. Our team designs and deploys production-ready AI agent systems on a proven stack of Kubernetes, Kafka, and Postgres – the same infrastructure trusted by enterprise teams worldwide. When we recommend an approach, it is because we have built and run it ourselves.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Speed Without Compromise</h3>\n                    <p>Where traditional deployments take weeks of back-and-forth, our multi-agent pipelines get websites and automation workflows live in minutes. Automated builds, testing, and launches on Cloudflare mean fewer bottlenecks and faster results – without cutting corners on security or reliability.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Hierarchical Multi-Agent Architecture</h3>\n                    <p>We specialise in hierarchical agent systems that delegate intelligently, collaborate in real time, and scale as your needs grow. Rather than bolting AI onto existing processes, we design orchestration layers that genuinely change how work gets done – supporting a broad range of LLMs and models to suit your environment.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Enterprise-Grade Security and Reliability</h3>\n                    <p>Every system we build is designed with security and resilience from the ground up. Hosted on Cloudflare's global network with automated testing baked into every deployment, our solutions are built to handle real production demands – not just proof-of-concept demos.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Practical AI Adoption, Not Hype</h3>\n                    <p>We cut through the noise to focus on what actually works for your business. Our digital transformation guidance is grounded in clear roadmaps, realistic timelines, and measurable workflow improvements – helping technology leaders make confident decisions without the jargon.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Web Automation as a Foundation for Growth</h3>\n                    <p>Our deep focus on web automation gives clients a strong, scalable starting point. As your ambitions grow, our agent orchestration capabilities extend naturally into broader operational areas – giving you a platform that evolves alongside your business rather than one you outgrow.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n<style>\n.differentiators-section {\n    padding: var(--spacing-section, 5rem 2rem);\n    background: var(--color-background, #fff);\n}\n.differentiators-container {\n    max-width: var(--container-max-width, 1200px);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.differentiators-section h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);\n    margin-bottom: 3rem;\n    color: var(--color-primary, #1a1a2e);\n}\n.differentiators-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n}\n.differentiator-item {\n    padding: 2rem;\n    background: var(--color-surface, #f8f9fa);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent, #0f3460);\n}\n.differentiator-item h3 {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n    color: var(--color-primary, #1a1a2e);\n}\n.differentiator-item p {\n    color: var(--color-text-muted, #555);\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    margin: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .differentiators-section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }\n    .differentiators-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n</style>	\N	\N	\N	5d7dfbdf-e3fc-40b8-a8bb-d4bb7db76064	2026-03-09 18:18:38.510567+00	2026-03-09 18:18:38.510567+00	deployed	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
