f1e924d5-29a6-43f4-a0d2-9dfc164d1f0b	c0c68034-469f-420c-90bd-d3c0fc0e13d2	\N	2	about-content	\N	<section class="about-content-section" data-component="about-content">\n    <div class="about-container">\n        <h2>About FineTuning</h2>\n        <div class="about-text">\n            <p>FineTuning exists because most UK small businesses deserve a straight answer about AI — not a sales pitch, not a jargon-filled presentation, and certainly not a solution looking for a problem.</p><p>We work with SMEs across the UK who are curious about what AI can genuinely do for their business. That means sitting down, understanding how you actually work, and being honest about where AI will help and where it won't. Sometimes the answer is a well-configured tool that saves your team hours each week. Sometimes it's a clearer process before any technology gets involved. We'll tell you which is which.</p><p>The AI landscape moves fast, and a lot of what's written about it is aimed at enterprise budgets and enterprise problems. We focus on the practical middle ground — the real decisions that owner-managed businesses and growing teams face every day. How do you use AI without losing the personal touch your clients value? What's worth paying for, and what's hype? How do you bring your team along without overwhelming them?</p><p>These are the questions we've built our work around. No unnecessary complexity, no overselling, no disappearing after the kickoff call. Just practical guidance from people who've done the work themselves.</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class="about-highlights">\n            \n            <div class="highlight-item">\n                <h3>Honest Assessment First</h3>\n                <p>We start every engagement by understanding your business, not by recommending a product. If AI isn't the right fit for a particular problem, we'll say so.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="highlight-item">\n                <h3>Built for UK SMEs</h3>\n                <p>Our focus is firmly on the realities of running a small or medium-sized business in the UK — the budgets, the team sizes, and the practical constraints that come with it.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="highlight-item">\n                <h3>No Jargon, No Hype</h3>\n                <p>We translate AI developments into plain language and actionable steps. You won't leave a conversation with us more confused than when you arrived.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="highlight-item">\n                <h3>Practical Results Over Promises</h3>\n                <p>We measure success by whether your business actually runs better — time saved, decisions improved, or capabilities your team didn't have before.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n.about-content-section {\n    padding: 5rem 2rem;\n    background: #fff;\n}\n.about-container {\n    max-width: 1000px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.about-content-section h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);\n    margin-bottom: 2rem;\n    color: #1a1a2e;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n.about-text {\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    color: #333;\n    margin-bottom: 3rem;\n}\n.about-text p {\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n}\n.about-highlights {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n    margin-top: 3rem;\n}\n.highlight-item {\n    padding: 1.5rem;\n    background: #f8f9fa;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border-left: 4px solid #0f3460;\n}\n.highlight-item h3 {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n    color: #1a1a2e;\n}\n.highlight-item p {\n    color: #555;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .about-content-section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }\n    .about-highlights { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n</style>	\N	\N	\N	755d4b47-6bd0-4de3-bf8e-1224acf9b584	2026-03-09 19:47:55.55832+00	2026-03-09 19:47:55.55832+00	deployed	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
579edf0c-62be-498d-a938-ede858f51542	c0c68034-469f-420c-90bd-d3c0fc0e13d2	\N	3	leadership-team	\N	<section class="team-section" data-component="leadership-team">\n    <div class="team-container">\n        <h2>The People Behind FineTuning</h2>\n        <p class="section-intro"><p>We're practitioners, not evangelists. The FineTuning team is made up of people who have spent years working with real businesses — understanding their constraints, their scepticism, and their genuine need for tools that actually save time and money. We don't sell AI for the sake of it. We help UK SMEs figure out where it genuinely helps, and where it doesn't.</p></p>\n        <div class="team-grid">\n            \n            <div class="team-member">\n                \n                <h3>To be added</h3>\n                <p class="member-title">Founder</p>\n                <p class="member-bio">With a background in working directly with small and medium-sized businesses, our founder started FineTuning after seeing too many companies sold expensive, overcomplicated AI solutions they didn't need — or miss out entirely because nobody explained things plainly. FineTuning exists to close that gap.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="team-member">\n                \n                <h3>To be added</h3>\n                <p class="member-title">AI Implementation Lead</p>\n                <p class="member-bio">Our implementation lead focuses on the unglamorous but essential work: getting AI tools to fit into how a business actually operates. That means understanding existing workflows, spotting where automation creates real value, and making sure nothing is deployed that the team can't use confidently.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="team-member">\n                \n                <h3>To be added</h3>\n                <p class="member-title">SME Strategy Consultant</p>\n                <p class="member-bio">Having worked inside small businesses as well as advising them, our strategy consultant brings a grounded perspective to every engagement. The question is never 'what AI can we use?' — it's 'what problem are we actually solving, and is AI genuinely the right answer?'</p>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n.team-section {\n    padding: 5rem 2rem;\n    background: #f8f9fa;\n}\n.team-container {\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.team-section h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n    color: #1a1a2e;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n.section-intro {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto 3rem;\n    color: #555;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n}\n.team-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n}\n.team-member {\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 2rem;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n}\n.member-photo {\n    width: 120px;\n    height: 120px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n    background: #e0e0e0;\n}\n.team-member h3 {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n    color: #1a1a2e;\n}\n.member-title {\n    color: #0f3460;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n}\n.member-bio {\n    color: #555;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    text-align: left;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .team-section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }\n    .team-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n</style>	\N	\N	\N	196b703f-4f55-4635-9647-7201cd28fe6d	2026-03-09 19:47:55.571741+00	2026-03-09 19:47:55.571741+00	deployed	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
