0ff9bd17-ccbd-46b6-8c3e-0df6ad46870f	ff5e75e3-547b-4a91-b00b-766d144ea4b9	e7fc34f7-ef74-4665-830d-2c130c689002	2	case-studies-list	\N	<section class="case-studies-section" data-component="case-studies-list">\n    <div class="case-studies-container">\n        <h2>Real Results from AI-Powered Solutions</h2>\n        <p class="case-studies-subtitle">See how our intelligent automation helps businesses launch faster, work smarter, and achieve their goals</p>\n        <div class="case-studies-grid">\n            \n            <article class="case-study-item">\n                <h3>Automated Website Solutions</h3>\n                <p class="case-study-client">Small Business & Startup Launches</p>\n                <p>Businesses need professional websites quickly without the usual delays of traditional development. Our AI agents handle everything from planning and design to content creation and secure deployment.</p>\n                <p class="case-study-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Fully functional, SEO-optimized websites launched in minutes rather than weeks, allowing businesses to establish their online presence immediately and start reaching customers faster</p>\n            </article>\n            \n            <article class="case-study-item">\n                <h3>Custom AI Tools & Calculators</h3>\n                <p class="case-study-client">Service Providers & E-commerce Sites</p>\n                <p>Companies wanting to provide value-added tools to their visitors—mortgage calculators, pricing estimators, comparison tools—without needing a development team. We create fully functional, mobile-friendly calculators tailored to specific business needs.</p>\n                <p class="case-study-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Interactive tools that engage visitors, demonstrate expertise, and help customers make informed decisions, all delivered ready to use or embed within existing websites</p>\n            </article>\n            \n            <article class="case-study-item">\n                <h3>Reports, Plans & Research</h3>\n                <p class="case-study-client">Consultants & Growing Businesses</p>\n                <p>Professionals requiring comprehensive business plans, market research, or presentation materials needed detailed, well-researched documents with professional formatting, charts, and actionable recommendations.</p>\n                <p class="case-study-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Complete, presentation-ready reports with visual elements and clear insights, enabling clients to make strategic decisions, pitch investors, or present findings with confidence</p>\n            </article>\n            \n            <article class="case-study-item">\n                <h3>Creative & Personalised Generators</h3>\n                <p class="case-study-client">Marketers & Content Creators</p>\n                <p>Teams needing creative assets quickly—mood boards for campaigns, custom quizzes for engagement, travel planners for clients, or branded imagery packs—without hiring multiple specialists or spending days on design.</p>\n                <p class="case-study-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Eye-catching, personalized creative materials delivered rapidly, helping marketing teams maintain momentum, engage audiences, and deliver impressive results without bottlenecks</p>\n            </article>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n/* Layout only - colors inherited from global CSS */\n.case-studies-section {\n    padding: var(--spacing-section, 5rem 2rem);\n    background: var(--color-surface, #f8f9fa);\n}\n.case-studies-container {\n    max-width: var(--container-max-width, 1200px);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.case-studies-section h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n.case-studies-subtitle {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 0 auto 3rem;\n}\n.case-studies-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, min