623188b4-c177-47e3-86a3-95dfec05e4d2	ca8d8278-4bce-459b-a167-18a89184d1b1	b08af694-4c04-459d-aed8-7ad2fba93450	2	use-cases-list	\N	<section class="use-cases-section" data-component="use-cases-list">\n    <div class="use-cases-container">\n        <h2>Real Results Across Industries</h2>\n        <p class="use-cases-subtitle">See how our AI-powered solutions help businesses launch faster, work smarter, and deliver professional results in minutes instead of weeks</p>\n        <div class="use-cases-grid">\n            \n            <article class="use-case-item">\n                <h3>Launch-Ready Business Websites</h3>\n                <p class="use-case-client">Small Business & Startup Sector</p>\n                <p>New businesses and startups need professional websites quickly to establish credibility and start attracting customers. Our automated website solutions handle everything from design and content to SEO and secure deployment, eliminating the typical weeks-long process and multiple specialist costs.</p>\n                <p class="use-case-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Fully functional, mobile-responsive websites launched and live within minutes, complete with professional design, optimized content, and secure hosting—ready to welcome visitors immediately</p>\n            </article>\n            \n            <article class="use-case-item">\n                <h3>Client-Facing Calculation Tools</h3>\n                <p class="use-case-client">Professional Services & Consultants</p>\n                <p>Consultants, mortgage advisors, tradespeople, and service providers need interactive tools that help clients understand costs, compare options, or estimate requirements. Our custom calculator service creates fully functional web tools tailored to any industry—from mortgage calculators to material estimators.</p>\n                <p class="use-case-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Professional, mobile-friendly calculators deployed and ready to embed on websites or share with clients, enhancing service delivery and client engagement</p>\n            </article>\n            \n            <article class="use-case-item">\n                <h3>Comprehensive Business Planning</h3>\n                <p class="use-case-client">Entrepreneurs & Growing Businesses</p>\n                <p>Businesses seeking funding, entering new markets, or planning expansion need thorough research and professional documentation. Our AI teams compile market research, competitive analysis, and financial projections into polished business plans with charts and clear recommendations.</p>\n                <p class="use-case-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Professional business plans and market research reports complete with data visualization, actionable insights, and presentation-ready formatting</p>\n            </article>\n            \n            <article class="use-case-item">\n                <h3>Marketing Content at Scale</h3>\n                <p class="use-case-client">Marketing Teams & Agencies</p>\n                <p>Marketing professionals need compelling visuals, mood boards, and creative assets quickly to pitch ideas, support campaigns, or engage audiences. Our creative generators produce custom imagery packs, mind maps, and visual content tailored to specific brands and campaigns.</p>\n                <p class="use-case-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Eye-catching visual assets and creative materials delivered rapidly, enabling faster campaign launches and client presentations</p>\n            </article>\n            \n            <article class="use-case-item">\n                <h3>Specialized Industry Tools</h3>\n                <p class="use-case-client">Niche Service Providers</p>\n                <p>Businesses with unique calculation needs—from network speed estimators to sustainability assessments—require custom tools that don't exist off-the-shelf. Our AI tool builders create specialized calculators and comparison tools for any industry requirement.</p>\n                <p class="use-case-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Bespoke web tools designed for specific business needs, fully functional and ready to integrate into existing workflows or client services</p>\n            </article>\n            \n            <article class="use-case-item">\n                <h3>Research-Based Presentations</h3>\n                <p class="use-case-client">Consultants & Advisory Services</p>\n                <p>Professionals need to transform complex research, academic papers, or technical data into clear, visually engaging presentations for clients or stakeholders. Our reporting service extracts key insights and creates professional presentations with charts, summaries, and actionable recommendations.</p>\n                <p class="use-case-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Polished, presentation-ready reports that translate dense information into accessible, visually compelling formats with clear takeaways</p>\n            </article>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n.use-cases-section {\n    padding: var(--spacing-section, 5rem 2rem);\n    background: var(--color-surface, #f8f9fa);\n}\n.use-cases-container {\n    max-width: var(--container-max-width, 1200px);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.use-cases-section h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n.use-cases-subtitle {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 0 auto 3rem;\n}\n.use-cases-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n}\n.use-case-item {\n    padding: 2rem;\n    background: var(--color-background, #fff);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n}\n.use-case-item h3 {\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n}\n.use-case-client {\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n    color: var(--color-text-muted, #666);\n}\n.use-case-results {\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n    padding-top: 1rem;\n 