0ecb63be-8aba-4e18-86b7-5f5b27be6ecc	66f5a351-1dc3-43c7-bf78-8f1bf47eb9f8	96ceb704-57b9-4d27-b90a-1bfcf207b929	2	about-content	\N	<section class="about-content-section" data-component="about-content">\n    <div class="about-container">\n        <h2>About Leopardess Consulting</h2>\n        <div class="about-text">\n            <p>Leopardess Consulting was founded on a simple belief: every business deserves access to powerful digital tools without the complexity, cost, or time commitment traditionally required.</p><p>We harness advanced AI technology to deliver what used to take weeks of work from multiple specialists—beautiful websites, functional calculators, detailed reports, and creative assets—all in minutes rather than days. Our intelligent systems handle the planning, design, content creation, and technical deployment, so you can focus on running your business.</p><p>Whether you're a startup founder launching your first site, a consultant needing a professional business plan, a marketer requiring custom tools for your campaigns, or a small business owner who simply wants impressive results without the hassle, we've built our services with you in mind.</p><p>We believe technology should work for you, not the other way around. That's why we've created AI-powered solutions that are professional, practical, and refreshingly straightforward to use.</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class="about-highlights">\n            \n            <div class="highlight-item">\n                <h3>Speed Without Compromise</h3>\n                <p>Our AI teams deliver professional-quality websites, tools, and reports in minutes, not weeks—without sacrificing quality or functionality.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="highlight-item">\n                <h3>Complete Solutions</h3>\n                <p>From initial planning and design through to content creation, SEO optimisation, and secure deployment, we handle every aspect of your digital project.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="highlight-item">\n                <h3>Built for Real Business Needs</h3>\n                <p>Whether you need a business site, a mortgage calculator, a market research report, or a creative mood board, our tools solve real problems for busy professionals.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="highlight-item">\n                <h3>Accessible Expertise</h3>\n                <p>No need to hire multiple specialists or learn complex platforms. Our AI handles the technical complexity while you maintain full control of the outcomes.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n.about-content-section {\n    padding: 5rem 2rem;\n    background: #fff;\n}\n.about-container {\n    max-width: 1000px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.about-content-section h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);\n    margin-bottom: 2rem;\n    color: #1a1a2e;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n.about-text {\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    color: #333;\n    margin-bottom: 3rem;\n}\n.about-text p {\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n}\n.about-highlights {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n    margin-top: 3rem;\n}\n.highlight-item {\n    padding: 1.5rem;\n    background: #f8f9fa;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border-left: 4px solid #0f3460;\n}\n.highlight-item h3 {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n    color: #1a1a2e;\n}\n.highlight-item p {\n    color: #555;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .about-content-section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }\n    .about-highlights { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n</style>	\N	\N	\N	993b4263-cc5f-4e93-ba61-9daae6423d1f	2026-02-20 10:53:24.700877+00	2026-02-20 10:53:24.700877+00	deployed	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
bfe11742-2eb9-491c-9f47-69a721e0ddda	66f5a351-1dc3-43c7-bf78-8f1bf47eb9f8	909467e3-6964-4029-9331-d8ecb48526da	4	differentiators	\N	<section class="differentiators-section" data-component="differentiators">\n        <div class="differentiators-container">\n            <h2>What Makes Leopardess Consulting Different</h2>\n            <div class="differentiators-grid">\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>AI Teams, Not Templates</h3>\n                    <p>We don't just offer templates or basic automation. Our intelligent AI agents work together to plan, design, build, and deploy complete solutions tailored to your specific needs – from fully functional websites to custom calculators and comprehensive business reports.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Minutes, Not Months</h3>\n                    <p>Traditional agencies take weeks and require multiple specialists. Our AI-powered approach delivers professional results in minutes, not months. Launch a complete website, generate a detailed market research report, or create a custom calculator tool – all while you focus on running your business.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>No Technical Skills Required</h3>\n                    <p>You don't need to know coding, design principles, or SEO strategies. Our AI teams handle the technical complexity behind the scenes, delivering polished, professional results that look like they came from a full creative agency – without the learning curve or the hefty price tag.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Complete Solutions, Not Piecemeal Services</h3>\n                    <p>Why juggle multiple freelancers or tools? We provide end-to-end solutions: websites with content, images, and SEO; calculators that are fully functional and mobile-ready; reports with charts, analysis, and recommendations. Everything you need, delivered together and ready to use.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Built for Busy Teams</h3>\n                    <p>Small business owners, startups, consultants, and marketers don't have time to become project managers. We've designed our services for people who need impressive digital results quickly, without the endless back-and-forth, revisions, and delays that come with traditional approaches.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Practical Tools That Work</h3>\n                    <p>From mortgage calculators to sustainability assessments, travel planners to business presentations – we create tools and content that serve real purposes. Everything we build is mobile-friendly, secure, and designed to work seamlessly whether standalone or embedded on your existing site.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n<style>\n.differentiators-section {\n    padding: var(--spacing-section, 5rem 2rem);\n    background: var(--color-background, #fff);\n}\n.differentiators-container {\n    max-width: var(--container-max-width, 1200px);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.differentiators-section h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);\n    margin-bottom: 3rem;\n    color: var(--color-primary, #1a1a2e);\n}\n.differentiators-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n}\n.differentiator-item {\n    padding: 2rem;\n    background: var(--color-surface, #f8f9fa);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent, #0f3460);\n}\n.differentiator-item h3 {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    margin-bo