9d18711d-ef24-476e-8c4f-10e4587bb877	386683a5-eb6b-4256-bacb-420c44bf4c4a	e7fc34f7-ef74-4665-830d-2c130c689002	2	case-studies-list	\N	<section class="case-studies-section" data-component="case-studies-list">\n    <div class="case-studies-container">\n        <h2>Real Problems, Practical Solutions</h2>\n        <p class="case-studies-subtitle">Examples of how we've helped businesses apply AI where it actually matters</p>\n        <div class="case-studies-grid">\n            \n            <article class="case-study-item">\n                <h3>Custom Model Fine-Tuning for Domain-Specific Tasks</h3>\n                <p class="case-study-client">Professional Services</p>\n                <p>When off-the-shelf AI doesn't understand your industry terminology or business context, fine-tuning creates a model that actually speaks your language. We work with businesses to train models on their specific documentation, processes, and domain knowledge.</p>\n                <p class="case-study-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Models that understand industry-specific terminology, handle edge cases properly, and integrate seamlessly into existing workflows without constant correction or supervision</p>\n            </article>\n            \n            <article class="case-study-item">\n                <h3>Intelligent Document Processing Pipeline</h3>\n                <p class="case-study-client">Operations & Administration</p>\n                <p>Moving beyond simple OCR to build AI agent systems that can read, understand, categorise, and route documents based on content and context. These systems handle exceptions, flag anomalies, and learn from corrections over time.</p>\n                <p class="case-study-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Automated processing of complex documents with decision-making capability, reducing manual review time while maintaining accuracy and audit trails</p>\n            </article>\n            \n            <article class="case-study-item">\n                <h3>Customer Service Automation</h3>\n                <p class="case-study-client">SME Support Teams</p>\n                <p>Building AI agents that can handle common enquiries, escalate appropriately, and maintain context across conversations. Not chatbots that frustrate customers, but systems that genuinely understand intent and provide useful responses.</p>\n                <p class="case-study-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Support teams freed to focus on complex cases while routine enquiries are handled reliably and consistently, with full transparency into how decisions are made</p>\n            </article>\n            \n            <article class="case-study-item">\n                <h3>Rapid Digital Tool Development</h3>\n                <p class="case-study-client">Growing Businesses</p>\n                <p>Through our Leopardess Consulting platform, we deploy custom calculators, planning tools, client-facing resources, and internal utilities in minutes rather than weeks. Multi-agent teams handle the entire build process from requirements to deployment.</p>\n                <p class="case-study-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Professional digital tools delivered at a fraction of traditional development time and cost, with full customisation and proper deployment</p>\n            </article>\n            \n            <article class="case-study-item">\n                <h3>AI Implementation Strategy</h3>\n                <p class="case-study-client">Technical Founders & Operations Managers</p>\n                <p>Cutting through the AI hype to identify the specific tasks where automation will genuinely save time and money right now. We help businesses prioritise opportunities, avoid costly mistakes, and build properly from the start.</p>\n                <p class="case-study-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Clear roadmap of practical AI opportunities with honest assessment of costs, timelines, and expected outcomes — no buzzwords, just actionable plans</p>\n            </article>\n            \n            <article class="case-study-item">\n                <h3>Inventory and Supply Chain Intelligence</h3>\n                <p class="case-study-client">Product-Based Businesses</p>\n                <p>AI agent systems that monitor stock levels, predict demand patterns, coordinate with suppliers, and flag potential issues before they become problems. These systems work across multiple data sources and adapt to seasonal variations.</p>\n                <p class="case-study-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Proactive inventory management that reduces stockouts and overstock situations while requiring minimal manual intervention</p>\n            </article>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n/* Layout only - colors inherited from global CSS */\n.case-studies-section {\n    padding: var(--spacing-section, 5rem 2rem);\n    background: var(--color-surface, #f8f9fa);\n}\n.case-studies-container {\n    max-width: var(--container-max-width, 1200px);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.case-studies-section h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n.case-studies-subtitle {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 0 auto 3rem;\n}\n.case-studies-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n}\n.case-study-item {\n    padding: 2rem;\n    background: var(--color-background, #fff);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n}\n.case-study-item h3 {\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n}\n.case-study-client {\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n    color: var(--color-text-muted, #666);\n}\n.case-study-results {\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n    padding-top: 1rem;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e2e8f0);\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .case-studies-section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }\n    .case-studies-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n</style>	\N