d9d08a96-5d4b-4cbf-8765-5bac7a8fa587	f6c5e61d-f1db-484f-b68b-4b71a21939c0	\N	2	section	\N	<section id="8d81e665-3ee0-443d-a873-690268c15fbb" class="section section--generic">\n  <div class="container">\n    <h2 class="section__title">Insights & Blog</h2>\n    <div class="section__content"><p>Welcome to the Leopardess Consulting blog, where we explore the intersection of artificial intelligence, digital transformation, and practical web solutions. Our insights are designed for technology leaders who need to move swiftly in today's rapidly evolving digital landscape—without sacrificing precision or strategic thinking.</p><p>Here you'll find actionable guidance on implementing AI-driven automation, navigating the complexities of modern web development, and leading digital transformation initiatives that deliver measurable results. We cut through the hype to provide CTOs and forward-thinking businesses with the practical knowledge needed to make informed technology decisions.</p><p>From emerging AI agent frameworks to proven strategies for legacy system modernization, our articles combine technical depth with business acumen. Whether you're evaluating new technologies, scaling your digital infrastructure, or seeking to optimize existing systems, our insights help you move with both agility and grace.</p><p>Stay tuned for regular updates as we share our expertise, lessons learned from client engagements, and perspectives on the technologies shaping the future of business. If you'd like to discuss how these insights apply to your specific challenges, reach out to us at leopardess.consulting@contactforsales.com or call +44 (0) 7934 524 911.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</section>	\N	\N	\N	214838cb-9665-431e-9537-160c49682600	2026-02-17 09:47:22.1477+00	2026-02-17 09:47:22.1477+00	deployed	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
6967300d-20f4-40e5-9ac3-398f16a94126	66f5a351-1dc3-43c7-bf78-8f1bf47eb9f8	be82aac8-c416-443a-a63f-0c58724a5b6b	3	departments-grid	\N	<section class="team-section" data-component="departments-grid">\n    <div class="team-container">\n        <h2>Our AI Departments</h2>\n        <p class="section-intro">Leopardess runs on specialist AI agent teams, each focused on a different discipline. They collaborate automatically to plan, build, and deliver your projects.</p>\n        <div class="team-grid">\n            \n            <div class="team-member">\n                <img src="/assets/images/departments/dept-strategy.jpg" alt="Strategy Department" class="member-photo">\n                <h3>Strategy</h3>\n                <p class="member-title">Planning & Direction</p>\n                <p class="member-bio">Every project starts here. Our strategy agents analyse your domain, audience, and objectives to create a structured build plan.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="team-member">\n                <img src="/assets/images/departments/dept-orchestration.jpg" alt="Orchestration Department" class="member-photo">\n                <h3>Orchestration</h3>\n                <p class="member-title">Coordination & Workflow</p>\n                <p class="member-bio">The nerve centre of every project. Our orchestration agents manage task sequencing and delegate work to specialist teams.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="team-member">\n                <img src="/assets/images/departments/dept-development.jpg" alt="Development Department" class="member-photo">\n                <h3>Development</h3>\n                <p class="member-title">Engineering & Build</p>\n                <p class="member-bio">Our development agents handle the technical build — assembling pages, wiring up functionality, and deploying to infrastructure.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="team-member">\n                <img src="/assets/images/departments/dept-design.jpg" alt="Design Department" class="member-photo">\n                <h3>Design</h3>\n                <p class="member-title">Visual & UX</p>\n                <p class="member-bio">Design agents select colour palettes, typography, and layout patterns matched to your industry and brand.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="team-member">\n                <img src="/assets/images/departments/dept-content.jpg" alt="Content Department" class="member-photo">\n                <h3>Content</h3>\n                <p class="member-title">Copywriting & Messaging</p>\n                <p class="member-bio">Content agents research your industry and write targeted copy for every section of your site.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="team-member">\n                <img src="/assets/images/departments/dept-seo-marketing.jpg" alt="SEO & Marketing Department" class="member-photo">\n                <h3>SEO & Marketing</h3>\n                <p class="member-title">Search & Visibility</p>\n                <p class="member-bio">Our SEO agents weave search optimisation into every page — meta tags, heading structure, and semantic markup.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="team-member">\n                <img src="/assets/images/departments/dept-analytics.jpg" alt="Analytics & Reporting Department" class="member-photo">\n                <h3>Analytics & Reporting</h3>\n                <p class="member-title">Data & Insights</p>\n                <p class="member-bio">Analytics agents generate structured reports, market research, and business intelligence documents.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n.team-section {\n    padding: 5rem 2rem;\n    background: #f8f9fa;\n}\n.team-container {\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.team-section h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n  