82960926-1b17-4b89-b499-1faf5273b413	a716cacc-eec2-4aa6-a08b-7e6732506f41	909467e3-6964-4029-9331-d8ecb48526da	2	differentiators	\N	<section class="differentiators-section" data-component="differentiators">\n        <div class="differentiators-container">\n            <h2>What makes us different</h2>\n            <div class="differentiators-grid">\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>No AI theatre</h3>\n                    <p>We're not here to sell you on the future of AI or impress you with jargon. We build things that work today, solve real problems, and pay for themselves quickly. If AI isn't the right solution, we'll tell you.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Built for British business</h3>\n                    <p>We understand UK SMEs because we are one. We know what it's like to have limited budgets, small teams, and no patience for technology that doesn't deliver. Our solutions are designed for businesses that need results, not research projects.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Your data stays yours</h3>\n                    <p>When we fine-tune models on your data, it remains your competitive advantage. We don't feed your information into public systems or share it across clients. Your terminology, your domain knowledge, your edge — all kept private.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Honest about limitations</h3>\n                    <p>AI is powerful but it's not magic. We're upfront about what works reliably and what doesn't. We'd rather under-promise and over-deliver than leave you with an expensive system that needs constant supervision.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Fast deployment</h3>\n                    <p>Most AI projects get stuck in endless planning phases. We believe in getting something working quickly, testing it in the real world, and improving from there. You'll see results in weeks, not quarters.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Support that actually helps</h3>\n                    <p>When you work with us, you get direct access to the people who built your system. No ticket queues, no offshore call centres, no reading from scripts. Just straightforward help from people who understand your business.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n<style>\n.differentiators-section {\n    padding: var(--spacing-section, 5rem 2rem);\n    background: var(--color-background, #fff);\n}\n.differentiators-container {\n    max-width: var(--container-max-width, 1200px);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.differentiators-section h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);\n    margin-bottom: 3rem;\n    color: var(--color-primary, #1a1a2e);\n}\n.differentiators-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n}\n.differentiator-item {\n    padding: 2rem;\n    background: var(--color-surface, #f8f9fa);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent, #0f3460);\n}\n.differentiator-item h3 {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n    color: var(--color-primary, #1a1a2e);\n}\n.differentiator-item p {\n    color: var(--color-text-muted, #555);\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    margin: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .differentiators-section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }\n    .differentiators-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n</style>	\N	\N	\N	3b1e2096-b4f6-412a-9d37-2b0194eb6b46	2026-02-22 16:19:58.602264+00	2026-02-22 16:19:58.602264+00	deployed	