797f318c-8027-4c7b-9196-499600201fb1	c5e3f65d-90e6-4c22-9944-49cc9b601786	\N	2	section	\N	<section id="8d81e665-3ee0-443d-a873-690268c15fbb" class="section section--generic">\n  <div class="container">\n    <h2 class="section__title">Join Our Pack</h2>\n    <div class="section__content"><p>At Leopardess Consulting, we're building the future of AI-driven digital transformation—one agile solution at a time. We're looking for talented individuals who share our passion for combining technical excellence with practical, business-focused outcomes.</p><p>We move with purpose and precision, helping technology leaders navigate complex challenges with grace. If you're excited about artificial intelligence, automation, and creating elegant solutions that drive real business value, you might be the perfect fit for our team.</p><p>We value curiosity, adaptability, and a commitment to continuous learning. Our consultants work directly with CTOs and technology leaders at forward-thinking organizations, which means you'll have the opportunity to make a meaningful impact from day one.</p><p>While we don't have any open positions at the moment, we're always interested in connecting with exceptional talent. If you're passionate about AI agents, web solutions, and helping businesses transform digitally, we'd love to hear from you.</p><p>Send your CV and a brief introduction about what excites you most about the future of AI and digital transformation to <a href="mailto:leopardess.consulting@contactforsales.com">leopardess.consulting@contactforsales.com</a>. We'll keep your information on file and reach out when opportunities arise that match your skills and interests.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</section>	\N	\N	\N	74e4f866-3090-4b29-aee4-c2c026eb026d	2026-02-17 09:49:36.520898+00	2026-02-17 09:49:36.520898+00	deployed	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
