dc76f205-66d1-48d7-a6e3-07caec567ef7	a716cacc-eec2-4aa6-a08b-7e6732506f41	a69d5eda-639c-4094-ac42-2b973a039acc	3	services-grid	\N	<section class="services-section" data-component="services-grid">\n    <div class="services-container">\n        <h2>What We Actually Do</h2>\n        \n        <div class="services-grid">\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Custom AI Model Fine-Tuning</h3>\n                <p>We take foundation models and make them yours. Fine-tuning on your data, your terminology, your domain — so the AI actually understands your business. We handle data assessment, model selection, training, validation, and deployment. The result is a model that performs dramatically better on your specific tasks than any off-the-shelf solution.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Agentic Systems Development</h3>\n                <p>Intelligent automation that goes beyond simple scripts. We build AI agent systems that can make decisions, handle exceptions, learn from outcomes, and coordinate complex multi-step workflows. From customer service automation to document processing pipelines to inventory management — agents that work reliably without constant supervision.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Automated Digital Solutions</h3>\n                <p>Through our Leopardess Consulting platform, we offer AI-powered creation of websites, custom tools, business reports, calculators, planners, and more — all delivered in minutes rather than weeks. Our multi-agent teams handle planning, design, content, images, and deployment end-to-end.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>AI Strategy & Consulting</h3>\n                <p>Not sure where to start with AI? We help businesses identify the practical opportunities — the tasks where AI will genuinely save time and money right now. No buzzword bingo, no five-year AI roadmaps gathering dust. Just clear advice on what to build first and how to build it properly.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n/* Layout only - colors inherited from global CSS */\n.services-section {\n    padding: var(--spacing-section, 5rem 2rem);\n}\n.services-container {\n    max-width: var(--container-max-width, 1200px);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.services-section h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n.services-subtitle {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 0 auto 3rem;\n}\n.services-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n}\n.service-item {\n    padding: 2rem;\n    background: var(--color-surface, #f8f9fa);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;\n}\n.service-item:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-4px);\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n}\n.service-item h3 {\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n.service-item p {\n    margin: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .services-section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }\n    .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }\n}\n</style>	\N	\N	\N	32ec06fd-f360-44ee-97c6-de40f420b261	2026-02-22 16:19:58.607478+00	2026-02-22 16:19:58.607478+00	deployed	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
131e58c7-3f76-4e24-9113-03a05e095454	a716cacc-eec2-4aa6-a08b-7e6732506f41	e7fc34f7-ef74-4665-830d-2c130c689002	4	case-studies-list	\N	<section class="case-studies-section" data-component="case-studies-list">\n    <div class="case-studies-container">\n        <h2>How We've Helped Businesses Apply AI</h2>\n        <p class="case-studies-subtitle">Real examples of practical AI implementation across different industries and use cases</p>\n        <div class="case-studies-grid">\n            \n            <article class="case-study-item">\n                <h3>Custom Model Fine-Tuning for Industry-Specific Language</h3>\n                <p class="case-study-client">Professional Services</p>\n                <p>A professional services firm needed AI that understood their sector's terminology and regulatory context. We fine-tuned a foundation model on their documentation, historical correspondence, and industry standards.</p>\n                <p class="case-study-results"><strong>Results:</strong> The custom model now handles client queries and document analysis with proper understanding of technical terms and compliance requirements, reducing the time staff spend on routine information requests.</p>\n            </article>\n            \n            <article class="case-study-item">\n                <h3>Document Processing Pipeline with AI Agents</h3>\n                <p class="case-study-client">Operations & Logistics</p>\n                <p>A logistics company was manually processing hundreds of delivery notes, invoices, and exception reports daily. We built an agentic system that extracts data, flags anomalies, routes issues to appropriate teams, and learns from corrections.</p>\n                <p class="case-study-results"><strong>Results:</strong> The system now handles routine document processing autonomously, escalating only genuine exceptions. Processing time for standard documents dropped significantly, and staff focus shifted to handling complex cases.</p>\n            </article>\n            \n            <article class="case-study-item">\n                <h3>Customer Service Automation with Context Awareness</h3>\n                <p class="case-study-client">E-commerce & Retail</p>\n                <p>An online retailer wanted to automate customer service responses without losing the personal touch. We developed an AI agent system trained on their product catalogue, policies, and previous successful interactions.</p>\n                <p class="case-study-results"><strong>Results:</strong> The system handles common queries accurately while maintaining brand voice, escalates complex issues appropriately, and continuously improves from feedback. Customer service capacity increased without additional headcount.</p>\n            </article>\n            \n            <article class="case-study-item">\n                <h3>Rapid Digital Asset Creation</h3>\n                <p class="case-study-client">Marketing & Communications</p>\n                <p>A marketing team needed to produce client-specific calculators, comparison tools, and interactive content quickly. Through our Leopardess Consulting platform, we deployed multi-agent teams to handle the entire creation process.</p>\n                <p class="case-study-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Tools that previously took weeks to brief, design, develop and deploy now arrive in hours. The team can respond to client requests and market opportunities much faster, with consistent quality.</p>\n            </article>\n            \n            <article class="case-study-item">\n                <h3>AI Strategy for Manufacturing Operations</h3>\n                <p class="case-study-client">Manufacturing & Production</p>\n                <p>A manufacturer wanted to explore AI but wasn't sure where to start. We conducted workshops to identify high-impact, low-risk opportunities in their quality control, inventory management, and maintenance scheduling processes.</p>\n                <p class="case-study-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Rather than a theoretical roadmap, the company received a prioritised list of specific projects with clear ROI estimates. They implemented the first recommendation within weeks and are now working through the pipeline.</p>\n            </article>\n            \n            <article class="case-study-item">\n                <h3>Workflow Automation for Financial Services</h3>\n                <p class="case-study-client">Financial Services</p>\n                <p>A financial services firm had complex multi-step workflows involving data gathering, verification, calculation, and reporting. We built an agentic system that coordinates these steps, handles variations, and maintains audit trails.</p>\n                <p class="case-study-results"><strong>Results:</strong> Processes that required multiple handoffs and manual checks now run reliably with AI coordination. Turnaround times improved, errors decreased, and compliance documentation is generated automatically.</p>\n            </article>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n/* Layout only - colors inherited from global CSS */\n.case-studies-section {\n    padding: var(--spacing-section, 5rem 2rem);\n    background: var(--color-surface, #f8f9fa);\n}\n.case-studies-container {\n    max-width: var(--container-max-width, 1200px);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.case-studies-section h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n.case-studies-subtitle {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 0 auto 3rem;\n}\n.case-studies-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n}\n.case-study-item {\n    padding: 2rem;\n    background: var(--color-background, #fff);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n}\n.case-study-item h3 {\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n}\n.case-study-client {\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    margin-bottom: 