0b2cfa81-4b9a-427d-9ca7-fad67ae2ec44	1e0f6525-ea9d-44d7-9353-1ba96c3f0123	\N	2	services-grid	\N	<section class="services-section" data-component="services-grid">\n    <div class="services-container">\n        <h2>What We Actually Do</h2>\n        \n        <div class="services-grid">\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>AI Readiness Assessment</h3>\n                <p>Before spending a penny on AI tools, find out where they'll genuinely help and where they won't. We look at your current processes, your data, and your team — and give you an honest picture of what's worth pursuing.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Process Automation</h3>\n                <p>Identify the repetitive, time-consuming tasks in your business and replace them with reliable automated workflows. We focus on the changes that free up your people to do work that actually needs a human.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>AI Tool Selection & Setup</h3>\n                <p>The market is full of AI tools making bold promises. We help you cut through the noise, choose what fits your business, and get it working properly — without locking you into expensive contracts you don't need.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Custom AI Integration</h3>\n                <p>When off-the-shelf tools don't quite fit, we build solutions that connect to your existing systems and workflows. Practical, maintainable, and built to solve a specific problem rather than impress a boardroom.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Staff Training & Adoption</h3>\n                <p>AI only delivers value if your team knows how to use it confidently. We run straightforward, hands-on training that gets people comfortable with new tools — and honest about their limitations.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Ongoing Advisory</h3>\n                <p>AI isn't a one-time project. As tools improve and your business changes, we're available to help you adapt — without the retainer fees of a large consultancy or the guesswork of going it alone.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n/* Layout only - colors inherited from global CSS */\n.services-section {\n    padding: var(--spacing-section, 5rem 2rem);\n}\n.services-container {\n    max-width: var(--container-max-width, 1200px);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.services-section h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n.services-subtitle {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 0 auto 3rem;\n}\n.services-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n}\n.service-item {\n    padding: 2rem;\n    background: var(--color-surface, #f8f9fa);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;\n}\n.service-item:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-4px);\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n}\n.service-item h3 {\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n.service-item p {\n    margin: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .services-section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }\n    .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }\n}\n</style>	\N	\N	\N	3d45e701-73a7-4861-ab44-aaba3043e71c	2026-03-09 20:05:54.288901+00	2026-03-09 20:05:54.288901+00	deployed	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
