3e4a2a3d-ef68-4da8-b962-34a791f71184	2db03360-59cc-485f-bd6d-ec66b2b53158	\N	1	hero	\N	<section class="about-content-section" data-component="about-content">\n    <div class="about-container">\n        <h2>About Fleet Fuel Services</h2>\n        <div class="about-text">\n            <p>Fleet Fuel Services is a trusted gas wholesaler dedicated to providing reliable fuel solutions for commercial fleets, transportation companies, and businesses with significant fuel needs. We understand that fuel is more than just a commodity—it's a critical component of your operations that directly impacts your bottom line and service delivery.</p><p>Our approach is built on three core principles: competitive wholesale pricing, dependable supply chains, and personalized service that adapts to your unique requirements. Whether you operate a fleet of delivery vehicles, construction equipment, or transportation services, we work to ensure your fuel needs are met efficiently and cost-effectively.</p><p>We've built our reputation by focusing on what matters most to fleet operators: consistent fuel quality, transparent pricing structures, and responsive support when you need it. Our team brings extensive industry knowledge to every partnership, helping businesses navigate fuel management challenges and optimize their operational costs.</p><p>At Fleet Fuel Services, we recognize that every fleet has different demands based on size, routes, and operational patterns. That's why we take the time to understand your specific situation and develop fuel supply solutions that align with your business goals. From small regional fleets to large-scale operations, we're committed to being a fuel partner you can count on.</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class="about-highlights">\n            \n            <div class="highlight-item">\n                <h3>Wholesale Fuel Expertise</h3>\n                <p>Deep industry knowledge and established supplier relationships that enable us to deliver 