8321a1fb-73e8-4e51-b65a-be422648cd65	b2edae00-c10e-404a-9937-1ed969cd4d62	\N	2	features	\N	<section class="features-section" data-component="features">\n    <div class="features-container">\n        <h2>What Our AI Teams Actually Build</h2>\n        <p class="features-subtitle">Not advice. Not roadmaps. Working systems — deployed on a proven enterprise stack and ready to handle real workloads from day one.</p>\n        <div class="features-grid">\n            \n            <div class="feature-item">\n                <div class="feature-icon"><i data-lucide="globe"></i></div>\n                <h3>Website Generation at Speed</h3>\n                <p>Coordinated AI agents research, write, design, and deploy complete websites in minutes. Each agent handles a defined role — content, structure, styling, deployment — so the output is coherent, consistent, and production-ready without the usual back-and-forth.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="feature-item">\n                <div class="feature-icon"><i data-lucide="cpu"></i></div>\n                <h3>Hierarchical Multi-Agent Orchestration</h3>\n                <p>Our systems use structured agent hierarchies where a director agent delegates to specialist sub-agents, each with a clear scope of work. This mirrors how high-performing human teams operate — with oversight, accountability, and parallel execution built in.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="feature-item">\n                <div class="feature-icon"><i data-lucide="layers"></i></div>\n                <h3>Enterprise-Grade Infrastructure</h3>\n                <p>Every deployment runs on a hardened stack: Kubernetes for container orchestration, Kafka for reliable event streaming between agents, and Postgres for structured data persistence. The same foundations used by teams running mission-critical systems at scale.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="feature-item">\n                <div class="feature-icon"><i data-lucide="file-text"></i></div>\n                <h3>Automated Reports and Intelligence Briefs</h3>\n                <p>AI agents gather data from multiple sources, synthesise findings, and produce structured reports without manual effort. Whether you need competitive analysis, technical summaries, or operational snapshots, the output arrives ready to act on.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="feature-item">\n                <div class="feature-icon"><i data-lucide="shield"></i></div>\n                <h3>Security and Reliability by Default</h3>\n                <p>Security is not an afterthought. Access controls, secrets management, and network policies are configured from the start. Systems are designed to stay up, recover gracefully, and handle load — because production environments do not forgive shortcuts.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="feature-item">\n                <div class="feature-icon"><i data-lucide="zap"></i></div>\n                <h3>Rapid Deployment Without Compromise</h3>\n                <p>Fast does not mean fragile. Our agile approach to AI orchestration means new tools, microsites, and automated workflows can go from brief to live deployment in a fraction of the time traditional development requires — without cutting corners on reliability or maintainability.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="feature-item">\n                <div class="feature-icon"><i data-lucide="tool"></i></div>\n                <h3>Custom Internal Tools and Automation</h3>\n                <p>Beyond websites, our agents build functional internal tools — dashboards, data pipelines, workflow automations — tailored to how your team actually works. If a repetitive process is consuming skilled time, it is a candidate for automation.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="feature-item">\n                <div class="feature-icon"><i data-lucide="git-branch"></i></div>\n                <h3>Systems That Grow With You</h3>\n                <p>The architecture we deploy is designed to extend. New agents can be added, new data sources connected, and new workflows introduced without rebuilding from scratch. Digital transformation is not a single project — it is an ongoing capability.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n/* Layout only - colors inherited from global CSS */\n.features-section {\n    padding: var(--spacing-section, 5rem 2rem);\n}\n.features-container {\n    max-width: var(--container-max-width, 1200px);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.features-section h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n.features-subtitle {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 0 auto 3rem;\n}\n.features-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n}\n.feature-item {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 2rem;\n}\n.feature-icon {\n    width: 48px;\n    height: 48px;\n    margin: 0 auto 1rem;\n    color: var(--color-accent, #0f3460);\n}\n.feature-icon svg {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n}\n.feature-item h3 {\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n.feature-item p {\n    margin: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .features-section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }\n    .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }\n}\n</style>	\N	\N	\N	b670337b-62a3-4494-ba53-35ce01b9b2b4	2026-03-09 17:58:52.694443+00	2026-03-09 17:58:52.694443+00	deployed	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
6ebe0d00-858f-402e-b276-76ee1debb113	b2edae00-c10e-404a-9937-1ed969cd4d62	\N	3	differentiators-section	\N	<section class="differentiators-section" data-component="differentiators">\n        <div class="differentiators-container">\n            <h2>Why Businesses Choose Leopardess Consulting</h2>\n            <div class="differentiators-grid">\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>AI Agents That Actually Ship</h3>\n                    <p>We build and deploy hierarchical multi-agent systems that perform real tasks in production environments — not prototypes that gather dust. Our agents orchestrate workflows, generate reports, and automate web operations end to end.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Minutes, Not Months</h3>\n                    <p>Our agile approach to AI orchestration means working systems reach production fast. Where traditional development cycles stretch into weeks, our agent-driven pipelines compress delivery without compromising quality or stability.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Enterprise-Grade Infrastructure</h3>\n                    <p>Every deployment is built on a proven stack — Kubernetes for container orchestration, Kafka for reliable event streaming, and Postgres for robust data persistence. The same foundations that power large-scale enterprise systems underpin every project we deliver.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Security and Reliability by Default</h3>\n                    <p>We treat security and uptime as baseline requirements, not optional extras. Our systems are architected for resilience from the ground up, giving technology leaders confidence that what we build will perform under real-world conditions.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Web Automation at the Core</h3>\n                    <p>Our primary focus is web automation — building sites, tools, and reports through intelligent agent workflows. This depth of specialisation means we solve web-layer problems with precision, and our expanding capability set means we grow alongside your needs.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Builders, Not Just Advisors</h3>\n                    <p>We do not produce strategy decks and walk away. We design, build, and deploy working systems. When we leave, you have running software — not a roadmap waiting for someone else to execute.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n<style>\n.differentiators-section {\n    padding: var(--spacing-section, 5rem 2rem);\n    background: var(--color-background, #fff);\n}\n.differentiators-container {\n    max-width: var(--container-max-width, 1200px);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.differentiators-section h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);\n    margin-bottom: 3rem;\n    color: var(--color-primary, #1a1a2e);\n}\n.differentiators-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n}\n.differentiator-item {\n    padding: 2rem;\n    background: var(--color-surface, #f8f9fa);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent, #0f3460);\n}\n.differentiator-item h3 {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n    color: var(--color-primary, #1a1a2e);\n}\n.differentiator-item p {\n    color: var(--color-text-muted, #555);\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    margin: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .differentiators-section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }\n    .differentiators-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n</style>	\N	\N	\N	6b5381c0-a5cf-4091-a3ef-8c6aa6cc9d93	2026-03-09 17:58:52.705169+00	2026-03-09 17:58:52.705169+00	deployed	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
1e35c82a-99e9-43ea-8b79-97c7afc36f4b	b2edae00-c10e-404a-9937-1ed969cd4d62	\N	4	services-grid	\N	<section class="services-section" data-component="services-grid">\n    <div class="services-container">\n        <h2>What We Build for You</h2>\n        \n        <div class="services-grid">\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>AI Agent Orchestration</h3>\n                <p>We design and deploy hierarchical multi-agent systems where specialised AI agents collaborate to complete complex tasks autonomously. From research and data gathering to content generation and reporting, our agents coordinate in real time — reducing manual workload and accelerating output across your organisation.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Rapid Website Delivery</h3>\n                <p>Need a fully functional website built fast? Our AI-assisted workflows compress delivery timelines dramatically. We handle architecture, content generation, and deployment so your team can focus on the business rather than the build.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Automated Reporting Tools</h3>\n                <p>We build AI-powered reporting pipelines that pull data from your sources, process it intelligently, and produce structured, readable reports on demand. Whether you need competitive analysis, operational summaries, or market intelligence, the system does the heavy lifting.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Web Automation & Scraping</h3>\n                <p>Our agents navigate, extract, and process information from the web at scale — feeding your internal tools, dashboards, and workflows with up-to-date data. Built with reliability and rate-limit awareness baked in from day one.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Enterprise-Grade Infrastructure</h3>\n                <p>Every system we build runs on a solid foundation: Kubernetes for container orchestration, Kafka for high-throughput event streaming, and Postgres for reliable data persistence. You get production-ready deployments with the security and resilience that technology leaders expect.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Custom Internal Tools</h3>\n                <p>We build bespoke internal tools that connect your data, automate repetitive processes, and give your team capabilities they didn't have before. If your business has a workflow that could be smarter, we'll engineer a system that makes it so.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n/* Layout only - colors inherited from global CSS */\n.services-section {\n    padding: var(--spacing-section, 5rem 2rem);\n}\n.services-container {\n    max-width: var(--container-max-width, 1200px);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.services-section h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n.services-subtitle {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 0 auto 3rem;\n}\n.services-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n}\n.service-item {\n    padding: 2rem;\n    background: var(--color-surface, #f8f9fa);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;\n}\n.service-item:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-4px);\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n}\n.service-item h3 {\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n.service-item p {\n    margin: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .services-section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }\n    .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }\n}\n</style>	\N	\N	\N	0827889d-8d0e-4c1e-a7de-838556c0ec9a	2026-03-09 17:58:52.711082+00	2026-03-09 17:58:52.711082+00	deployed	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
