79262716-2d79-465e-8b44-d7dd7de57380	4ff0e0ff-fab2-423e-a59c-b9de4674a84f	\N	3	services-grid	\N	<section class="services-section" data-component="services-grid">\n    <div class="services-container">\n        <h2>Wholesale Fuel Services Built for Serious Operations</h2>\n        \n        <div class="services-grid">\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Bulk Gasoline Supply</h3>\n                <p>Consistent, competitively priced gasoline supply for fuel retailers, gas station networks, and high-volume resellers. We work with established distribution infrastructure to keep your tanks full and your customers moving.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Wholesale Diesel Distribution</h3>\n                <p>Diesel supply for commercial fleets, agricultural operations, construction sites, and industrial facilities. Whether you need regular on-road diesel or off-road dyed diesel, we source and deliver at wholesale volume pricing.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Natural Gas Supply</h3>\n                <p>Wholesale natural gas procurement and supply for industrial facilities, commercial operations, and large-scale energy consumers. We navigate the supply chain so you get stable pricing and dependable delivery without the complexity.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Fleet Fueling Programs</h3>\n                <p>Structured fueling programs designed for commercial fleet operators who need predictable costs and reliable supply. We work directly with fleet managers to build supply arrangements that match your operational schedule.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Convenience Store & Retail Fuel Supply</h3>\n                <p>Wholesale fuel supply tailored to convenience store chains and independent fuel retailers. Straightforward pricing, consistent delivery schedules, and a supplier that understands the margin pressures of retail fuel operations.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class="service-item">\n                <h3>Contract & Spot Market Purchasing</h3>\n                <p>Whether you prefer the stability of a supply contract or the flexibility of spot market purchasing, we accommodate both. Our team knows the market and keeps you informed so you can make purchasing decisions with confidence.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n/* Layout only - colors inherited from global CSS */\n.services-section {\n    padding: var(--spacing-section, 5rem 2rem);\n}\n.services-container {\n    max-width: var(--container-max-width, 1200px);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.services-section h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n.services-subtitle {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 0 auto 3rem;\n}\n.services-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n}\n.service-item {\n    padding: 2rem;\n    background: var(--color-surface, #f8f9fa);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;\n}\n.service-item:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-4px);\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n}\n.service-item h3 {\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n.service-item p {\n    margin: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .services-section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }\n    .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }\n}\n</style>	\N	\N	\N	4d7166c1-3f61-4189-bb01-bf8e16f9b54a	2026-03-09 18:03:40.668128+00	2026-03-09 18:03:40.668128+00	deployed	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
293934f1-89e1-4cd5-ad91-ced069b7172e	4ff0e0ff-fab2-423e-a59c-b9de4674a84f	\N	4	differentiators-section	\N	<section class="differentiators-section" data-component="differentiators">\n        <div class="differentiators-container">\n            <h2>Why Fuel Buyers Work With Us</h2>\n            <div class="differentiators-grid">\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Straight Pricing, No Surprises</h3>\n                    <p>We quote what we charge. No hidden fees buried in the invoice, no last-minute adjustments at delivery. Gas station owners and fleet operators need predictable fuel costs — we make sure that's exactly what they get.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Supply You Can Count On</h3>\n                    <p>When demand spikes or the market gets tight, reliable supply becomes the difference between keeping your operation running and turning customers away. We maintain the supplier relationships and logistics infrastructure to keep product moving to your tanks.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Wholesale Access at Scale</h3>\n                    <p>Whether you're operating a single fuel retail location or managing bulk procurement across a commercial fleet or industrial facility, we provide access to wholesale pricing that reflects your actual volume and purchasing power.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>People Who Know the Business</h3>\n                    <p>You're not dealing with a call center reading from a script. Our team has direct experience in fuel distribution and understands the operational realities facing retailers, fleet managers, and industrial buyers.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>Flexible Delivery Logistics</h3>\n                    <p>Fuel needs don't follow a convenient schedule. We work with buyers to structure delivery timing and volume commitments that fit real operational demands — not just what's easiest on our end.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class="differentiator-item">\n                    <h3>A Distributor That Answers</h3>\n                    <p>Supply disruptions, billing questions, scheduling changes — these issues need a direct line to someone who can act on them. We keep communication straightforward and response times short.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n<style>\n.differentiators-section {\n    padding: var(--spacing-section, 5rem 2rem);\n    background: var(--color-background, #fff);\n}\n.differentiators-container {\n    max-width: var(--container-max-width, 1200px);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.differentiators-section h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);\n    margin-bottom: 3rem;\n    color: var(--color-primary, #1a1a2e);\n}\n.differentiators-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n}\n.differentiator-item {\n    padding: 2rem;\n    background: var(--color-surface, #f8f9fa);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent, #0f3460);\n}\n.differentiator-item h3 {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n    color: var(--color-primary, #1a1a2e);\n}\n.differentiator-item p {\n    color: var(--color-text-muted, #555);\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    margin: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .differentiators-section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }\n    .differentiators-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n</style>	\N	\N	\N	9ad8e2ac-c771-4c73-9b67-aa43207faf80	2026-03-09 18:03:40.67491+00	2026-03-09 18:03:40.67491+00	deployed	\N	\N	\